// Scope: pipeline stage 5 — emission orchestrator. Reads target spec, emits source.
// Anchor: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_generation_(compiler)
// Unifies: (per THESIS:188) coercion = emission. NO separate coercion engine. The compiler reads target spec and translates; coercion logic lives in THIS file. A worker hitting "I need to coerce X to Y" extends emit, not a new file.
//
