//   - emit: (InferredTree, TargetSpec) -> Result<TargetSource, Diagnostic>
//   - target-agnostic IR; per-target spec drives concrete emission
//
// Consumes:
//   - std/node.dag, std/diagnostic.dag
//   - compiler/04_infer.dag: InferredTree
//   - extdeps/languages/*.dag: TargetSpec
//
